[55.685, "o", "\u001b[1;35m\u23fa Claude\u001b[0m\r\n  The scaffold already exists in the repo and fully matches the CLAUDE.md spec:\r\n  \r\n  - **Vite + React (JS) config** at the root \u2014 `package.json`, `vite.config.js`, `index.html` (with Inter font link, c\r\n  orrect title/description).\r\n  - **App shell**: `Header` (wordmark + tagline), `main` with placeholder `ProfileForm`, `FilterBar`, `StatsBar`, `Res\r\n  ultsGrid` sections, and `Footer` \u2014 all small, single-purpose components, no router/state library.\r\n  - **`src/styles.css`**: full design system \u2014 CSS variables for the navy/indigo/cyan palette, 14px rounded cards, but\r\n  tons, inputs, chips, sliders, badges, responsive grid, and a 640px breakpoint.\r\n  - `npm run build` passes cleanly (37 modules, ~150KB bundle).\r\n  \r\n  No matching logic or data was added, per your instructions. The project is ready for the next step (dataset creation\r\n  ).\r\n\r\n"]
